 ('union','Union','LANCER Wiki contributors','https://lancer.wiki.gg/wiki/Union_Economic_Bureau','secondary_lore','Reference describes a communal post-capital Galactic Core, distinguished from diverse member nations.','Only the indexed/cached reference was available; direct main-title fetch failed. Political communalism does not settle every productive ownership question.'),
