 ('baronies','LANCER — lore misconceptions discussion','Community participants, Reddit','https://www.reddit.com/r/LancerRPG/comments/1x06kgd/share_common_lore_misconceptions/','community_discussion','Discussion warns that treating all Karrakin inhabitants as oppressed serfs is an oversimplification.','Discussion only; not adopted as proof of a welfare or productive system. A search-discovered fake-looking generic PDF was discarded.'),
 ('solar','Perry Rhodan — Posbi cycle discussion','rec.arts.sf.written participants','https://groups.google.com/g/rec.arts.sf.written/c/SUekcYwniEI','community_discussion','Discusses military robots and Terran service institutions.','Does not verify an ordinary Solar Imperium household access arrangement; fanfiction and long novel mirrors were not used.'),
