 ('dyson','Dyson Sphere Program — official store description','Youthcat Studio / Gamirror Games','https://store.steampowered.com/app/1366540/','official_game_description','COSMO engineers automate physical production and stellar energy supply for CentreBrain’s virtual worlds.','Store wording alone does not prove uploads; no real-world product price or current patch assertion is adopted.'),
