 ('aspera-research','Research','Per Aspera Wiki contributors','https://peraspera.fandom.com/wiki/Research','secondary_game_reference','Established colonies receive food, water/ice and power and generate research; actual supplied residents rather than an unimplemented terraforming proposal.','Research points and formal scientist roles cannot yield an all-person nonworking percentage.'),
 ('starsector','Starsector','Wikipedia contributors','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Starsector','secondary_reference','Factions, colony markets, crew hiring and unequal restrictions establish game context.','Does not verify Church-wide automation restraint or Tri-Tachyon ordinary provisioning. Fanfiction and mod populations are discarded.'),
